| _IdStart _IdTail

_IdStart
| lowercase_letter
| uppercase_letter
| "_"

_IdTail
| letter _IdTail
| digit _IdTail
| "_" _IdTail
|

_OptBlank
| space _OptBlank
|

Number
| "0" _AfterZero
| _NonZeroDec _ExpTail _ImagTail
