# Expressions
#
# An expression is a flat sequence: prefix operators, an operand with its
# trailers, then optionally a binary operator and the rest of the sequence.
# Every optional continuation is a shared prefix, so the generator factors it
# into a helper that allocates no node; only real operands, operators and
# trailers allocate. The rest of the sequence is flattened (`@<`) into the
# Expression it continues, so one Expression node holds the whole sequence as
# a flat list and its resolveExpression hook nests it in one pass:
# BinaryOperation and UnaryOperation nodes take their operands as children,
# trailers take their object as first child, and Conditional and
# NamedExpression take everything before them. A node's operator is the
# source text between its children.
#
# Disjunction is the same sequence without the conditional and walrus
# continuations, for positions Python restricts to a disjunction:
# comprehension iterables and conditions, conditional tests, lambda bodies,
# walrus values, yield operands and case patterns. It flattens and resolves
# the same way.

Expression@resolveExpression
| Name _OptBlank
| Name _OptBlank Trailers
| Name _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Name _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Name _OptBlank Conditional
| Name _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| Number _OptBlank
| Number _OptBlank Trailers
| Number _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Number _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Number _OptBlank Conditional
| Number _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| String _OptBlank
| String _OptBlank Trailers
| String _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| String _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| String _OptBlank Conditional
| String _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| Constant _OptBlank
| Constant _OptBlank Trailers
| Constant _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Constant _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Constant _OptBlank Conditional
| Constant _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| Parenthesized _OptBlank
| Parenthesized _OptBlank Trailers
| Parenthesized _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Parenthesized _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Parenthesized _OptBlank Conditional
| Parenthesized _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| List _OptBlank
| List _OptBlank Trailers
| List _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| List _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| List _OptBlank Conditional
| List _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| Brace _OptBlank
| Brace _OptBlank Trailers
| Brace _OptBlank BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Brace _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Expression@<
| Brace _OptBlank Conditional
| Brace _OptBlank Trailers Conditional
| Name _OptBlank NamedExpression
| UnaryOperation Expression@<
| Lambda
| Yield

Disjunction@resolveExpression
| Name _OptBlank
| Name _OptBlank Trailers
| Name _OptBlank BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| Name _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| Number _OptBlank
| Number _OptBlank Trailers
| Number _OptBlank BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| Number _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| String _OptBlank
