| Parenthesized _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| List _OptBlank
| List _OptBlank Trailers
| List _OptBlank BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| List _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| Brace _OptBlank
| Brace _OptBlank Trailers
| Brace _OptBlank BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| Brace _OptBlank Trailers BinaryOperation Disjunction@<
| UnaryOperation Disjunction@<

BinaryOperation
| "or"@-letter@-digit@-"_" _OptBlank
